{#
    VIP door — the link-preview page (see services\Vip::enter). Served only to
    things that aren't a browser navigating: chat and social unfurlers, mostly.
    The homepage's own card (head.twig, rendered for the homepage entry) with one
    change: og:url is the door, so the card links to the door and not past it.
    noindex — a door is private and must never land in a search index.
#}
{% set element = home %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ craft.app.language|slice(0,2) }}">
<head>
    {% include '_includes/page/head.twig' with {entry: home, element: home, ogUrl: doorUrl, tplPath: '_views/single/home/default'} %}
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url={{ siteUrl('') }}">
</head>
<body>
    <a href="{{ siteUrl('') }}">Continue to Jon Leverrier</a>
</body>
</html>
